bile/folders/1yfQW0e8H6q79ZXx4pyFTh3RQCm01czni?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_mo1008/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6e1ff/uploads/origins/fc25e0ff-5cda-49d3-be18-f47814bd3745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d679e1c54e95f720f716191962f37f7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51f6e1ff/uploads/origins/fc25e0ff-5cda-49d3-be18-f47814bd3745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d679e1c54e95f720f716191962f37f7, https://si.imgix.net/51f6e1ff/uploads/origins/fc25e0ff-5cda-49d3-be18-f47814bd3745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be49fc4f688a7fb6fb8e1d46135a73bd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51f6e1ff/uploads/origins/fc25e0ff-5cda-49d3-be18-f47814bd3745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9791833d0e7547f80d3d13b1d59410e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Could you draw my ff14 character?\n\nKaguya: Pink hair, with white highlights.\nEye colors are silver and light pink.\nPlease keep her bunny ears, tail, horns, face and body scales!\n\nI have included an outfit reference for her, please refer to the 服 folder! A pose that shows off her thigh scales would be nice but I will leave it up to you! You do not need to include her weapon.\n\nI have also included background reference suggestions, but if you would like to draw something else for her, please feel free! She is an astrologian so anything with moon and star motifs will work. Please draw something that you think will work! Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1izs844j_IXvG2it_9UMNHswQmWlCpQAz?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_mo1008/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b568dffe/uploads/origins/e9dc99ba-4b22-4ff6-8f18-6b6d3f2f4252?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px